2706505788,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hUgA8","user":{"login":"ghost","id":10137,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10137?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost","html_url":"https://github.com/ghost","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-07T13:51:51Z","updated_at":"2025-03-07T13:51:51Z","body":"Probably because the scenes tab is still open. If you then delete the file of it, it is still a valid, albeit unsaved scene. If you completely close the scene's tab in the editor prior to deleting it, it should not be re-created upon running the project. At least, this is the behavior I have come to expect of Godot.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2706505788/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2707106919","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103729#issuecomment-2707106919","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103729","id":2707106919,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hWyxn","user":{"login":"KingSupernova31","id":27539004,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3NTM5MDA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27539004?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KingSupernova31","html_url":"https://github.com/KingSupernova31","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KingSupernova31/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KingSupernova31/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KingSupernova31/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KingSupernova31/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KingSupernova31/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KingSupernova31/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KingSupernova31/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KingSupernova31/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KingSupernova31/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-07T18:19:36Z","updated_at":"2025-03-07T18:19:36Z","body":"Yeah, I think that's why. This is backwards from how everything else works; playing the project saves unsaved changes, it doesn't revert them.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2707106919/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2707126950","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103729#issuecomment-2707126950","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103729","id":2707126950,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hW3qm","user":{"login":"ghost","id":10137,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10137?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost","html_url":"https://github.com/ghost","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-07T18:31:03Z","updated_at":"2025-03-07T18:31:03Z","body":"> This is backwards from how everything else works;\n\nI agree, it is unexpected behavior. I believe people have reported on it before. I'm not quite sure what the outcome of that was. Whether someone was going to change that behavior or not. I'd have to dig in the Issues a bit to find those prior reports. I saw something similar to this report pass by maybe a month or 2 ago? Something like that.\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2707126950/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2707157244","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103729#issuecomment-2707157244","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103729","id":2707157244,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hW_D8","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-07T18:38:20Z","updated_at":"2025-03-07T18:38:20Z","body":"Godot saves all scenes by default before running the project unless you disable **Run > Auto Save > Save Before Running** in the Editor Settings.\n\nNote that https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/90034 will change this so that saving only occurs if needed, but deleted scenes will be resaved if they're marked as modified somehow.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2707157244/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2707274981","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103729#issuecomment-2707274981","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103729","id":2707274981,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hXbzl","user":{"login":"KingSupernova31","id":27539004,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3NTM5MDA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27539004?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KingSupernova31","html_url":"https://github.com/KingSupernova31","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KingSupernova31/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KingSupernova31/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KingSupernova31/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KingSupernova31/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KingSupernova31/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KingSupernova31/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KingSupernova31/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KingSupernova31/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KingSupernova31/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-07T19:46:38Z","updated_at":"2025-03-07T19:46:38Z","body":"I think the core problem here is that if you have a node tab open and delete that node, Godot's state after this is \"saved state: no node, unsaved state: yes node\". This is contrary to how everything else works; when I add a line to a file, the unsaved state is the new state, not the old one. It is only for file deletions where Godot treats the old state as the \"unsaved\" one, and thus if saved, it causes a reversion.\n\nI think the best fix for this would probably be to make it so that when a node is deleted, its tab is automatically closed.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2707274981/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2707691841","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103729#issuecomment-2707691841","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103729","id":2707691841,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hZBlB","user":{"login":"Devonus","id":76016097,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MDE2MDk3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76016097?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Devonus","html_url":"https://github.com/Devonus","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Devonus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Devonus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Devonus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Devonus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Devonus/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Devonus/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Devonus/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Devonus/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Devonus/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-07T23:20:10Z","updated_at":"2025-03-07T23:20:49Z","body":"I have something similar where an unsaved file will revert to the last saved file in the editor if you, for example, leave the application, switch to a different application, and come back to it. All unsaved work will be deleted and the file will revert to the last saved version. This was causing me a major headache trying to figure out why something wasn't working when I was looking at the documentation on chrome. ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2707691841/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2708246767","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103729#issuecomment-2708246767","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103729","id":2708246767,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hbJDv","user":{"login":"iway1","id":12774588,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNzc0NTg4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12774588?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/iway1","html_url":"https://github.com/iway1","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iway1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iway1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iway1/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iway1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iway1/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iway1/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iway1/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iway1/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iway1/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-08T12:46:10Z","updated_at":"2025-03-08T12:46:10Z","body":"could just add an option in godot settings to close tabs when their file is deleted","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2708246767/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2708426639","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103729#issuecomment-2708426639","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103729","id":2708426639,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hb0-P","user":{"login":"KingSupernova31","id":27539004,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3NTM5MDA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27539004?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KingSupernova31","html_url":"https://github.com/KingSupernova31","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KingSupernova31/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KingSupernova31/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KingSupernova31/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KingSupernova31/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KingSupernova31/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KingSupernova31/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KingSupernova31/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KingSupernova31/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KingSupernova31/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-08T18:14:42Z","updated_at":"2025-03-08T18:14:42Z","body":"That would be fine, though I'm not sure an option is necessary; is there a reason why someone would want the tab to stay open?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2708426639/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2708435227","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103729#issuecomment-2708435227","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103729","id":2708435227,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hb3Eb","user":{"login":"ghost","id":10137,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10137?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost","html_url":"https://github.com/ghost","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-08T18:33:06Z","updated_at":"2025-03-08T18:33:06Z","body":"> That would be fine, though I'm not sure an option is necessary; is there a reason why someone would want the tab to stay open?\n\nI can't imagine any such reason. Since, effectively, deleting a scene, keeping the tab open only to have it then save again, thru intent... well, the only somewhat practical use that _might_ have is to renaming the scene. But, you can already do that. Without having to delete it.\n\nTL;DR -- It is somewhat peculiar behavior not to automatically close the scene upon its deletion from the file tree. Without any practical, real world applications.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2708435227/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]